      </h2>

      <p class="float-in d3 mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl font-mono-tech text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-purple-200/85">
        Diecast, imports and figures pulled straight off the shelf &mdash; every car
        catalogued, photographed and filed by hand. Pick a category below, or jump
        straight into the full archive.
      </p>

