              Shop by Category
            </span>
          </div>

          <h2 class="mt-5 text-2xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-white">
            Every Shelf in the Vault
          </h2>

          <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl font-mono-tech text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-purple-200/80">
            Six lanes, one collection. Each card is a live category from the NocoDB
            master sheet &mdash; tap one to open the catalog pre-filtered to that shelf.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Category cards -->
        <div id="categoryGrid" class="mt-9 sm:mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-6 gap-3 sm:gap-4">
          <!-- Populated from NocoDB -->
          <div class="col-span-full flex items-center justify-center py-16 font-mono-tech text-xs text-cyan-300 tracking-widest">
            <span class="pulse-dot mr-2 inline-block w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-300"></span>
            CONNECTING TO THE VAULT...
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="welcomeError" class="hidden mt-6 rounded-lg border border-yellow-500/40 bg-yellow-500/10 px-4 py-3 font-mono-tech text-[11px] text-yellow-200"></div>

        <!-- Panel footer -->
        <div class="mt-10 sm:mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-purple-500/25 pt-6">
          <p class="font-mono-tech text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] text-purple-300/80 uppercase text-center sm:text-left">
            Categorized live from NocoDB &middot; <span id="panelCount">--</span> shelves stocked
          </p>
          <a href="homepage.html"
             class="cyber-btn px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-mono-tech text-[10px] sm:text-xs tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-cyan-300 flex items-center gap-2 no-underline">
            View full catalog <span class="text-sm leading-none">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================================
         CLOSING BAND
         ============================================================ -->
    <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 pb-20">
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-cyan-400/25 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#160733] via-[#0b0320] to-[#200a12] px-6 sm:px-12 py-10 sm:py-12 text-center">
        <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-16 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-[#ff007f]/15 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-24 -left-16 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-[#00f3ff]/12 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

        <p class="font-marker text-lg sm:text-xl text-[#ff9ce3]">New arrivals every week</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-xl sm:text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-white">
          The vault never stops growing
        </h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl font-mono-tech text-xs sm:text-sm text-purple-200/80 leading-relaxed">
          Chase cars, imports, supers and shelf-warmers &mdash; all in one place.
          Dig through the crates and see what landed this week.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-7 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3">
          <a href="homepage.html"
